a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2f8d75439f8e94de\" href=\"?note=2f8d75439f8e94de\" title=\"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale\">14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bcaaa430e12534f8\" href=\"?note=bcaaa430e12534f8\" title=\"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves\">14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsLocalicTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X\\ (\\mathrm{IsLocale}(X)\\land\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf{Sh}(X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsLocalicTopos}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X\\ (\\mathrm{IsLocale}(X)\\land\\mathcal E\\simeq\\mathbf{Sh}(X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 IX.5 Localic Topoi，印刷页 488；DjVu 第 250 图页。明确 Grothendieck 范围，避免在缺任意小余积的初等拓扑斯上调用<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fc84ef09de6f7fd1\" href=\"?note=fc84ef09de6f7fd1\" title=\"14-thm-localic-topos-subterminal-generators\">14-thm-localic-topos-subterminal-generators</a>的生成条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos","status":"resolved","id":"2e748a8b3caef6a6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-giraud-grothendieck-topos]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale","status":"resolved","id":"2f8d75439f8e94de","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-frame-homomorphism-locale]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-locale-sites-and-sheaves","status":"resolved","id":"bcaaa430e12534f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on"